<%
  /*
   * Drop-in partial that wires the global 410 pending_deletion interceptor.
   *
   * Any page that lets a member interact with a community (dashboards,
   * map, dispatch, court session, etc.) should include this partial so
   * a soft-delete by the owner immediately evicts the user with a clean
   * "Community deleted" modal + redirect instead of leaving them stuck
   * on a dead screen making 410 requests.
   *
   * Owner-side delete handlers can call window.suppressPendingDeletion(id)
   * right after the delete API succeeds to mute the eviction modal for
   * that community (the owner already saw a delete confirmation, no need
   * for a second one).
   *
   * The script self-guards against being loaded twice.
   */
%>
<script src="/static/js/pending-deletion-gate.js"></script>
